  "description": "NetMetric.SystemIO.MacOS provides a macOS-specific implementation of IProcessIoReader for capturing real-time disk I/O metrics\n\t\t\tusing native APIs such as proc_pid_rusage. It enables high-resolution observability into process-level I/O statistics,\n\t\t\tincluding bytes read and written, for .NET applications running on macOS.",
